# One folder per season holds everything that season produced, and all of it is
# committed: without the ranked CSV and the archetype report in git there is
# nothing to diff next year's run against, which is the whole point of the
# per-season layout.
#
# The exception is the fetched payload cache. It is ~800 KB of raw Biwenger
# responses per season, it is reproducible from the API, and it says nothing a
# reader would ever want to read.
*/.cache/
